At Khalgan's hidden house, Moka found Krill chained and wounded among the bodies of missing women. Khalgan revealed the truth of his abuse and his obsession with creating an heir.
Moka fought him and fell. The others pulled her and Krill to safety.
Karak: I will kill him.
Renia: Not if it costs you your life before we can stop Zanarak.
